#
"FIRST AID"

| $c0011Sintassi         $c0007: first aid
| $c0011Classi           $c0007: Barbaro, Paladino livello 1
|                                Ranger livello 1
| $c0011Costo            $c0007: -
| $c0011Tipo di danno    $c0007: -
| $c0011Danno            $c0007: Cura limitata
| $c0011Durata           $c0007: Istantanea
